 "attributes": {
  "title": {
   "en": "Ore dake Status Open Dekiru Kudan ~Oredake Status Kakunin dekiru Sekai de Cheat Skill mo S-kyuu Item mo Erabihoudai~"
  },
  "altTitles": [
   {
    "ja": "俺だけステータスオープンできる件～俺だけステータス確認できる世界でチートスキルもS級アイテムも選び放題～"
   },
   {
    "ja-ro": "ore dake sute-tasu o-pun dekiru ken ore dake sute-tasu kakunin dekiru sekai de chi-tosukiru mo Skyuu aitemu mo erabihoudai"
   },
   {
    "en": "I'm the Only One Who can Open the Status Window: In a World Where I'm the Only One Who can See Statuses, I can Choose All the Cheat Skills and S-Rank Items I Want"
   }
  ],
  "description": {
   "en": "In this world, when people turn 15, they are granted a skill from the heavens. I, Hiraku Mattoh, was born into a family of Sword Saints and was hailed as a prodigy from a young age. Everyone was certain I would inherit the same title. However, at my skill appraisal ceremony, I received \"Unlocker\"—a seemingly worthless ability that could only \"open what is closed.\" Disappointed, my family branded it a trash skill and exiled me. Left adrift, I soon discovered its true power. By unlocking my status window, I could freely acquire skills, obtain item drops, and grow stronger without limit."
  },
